        "responseBody": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-Hant\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>訂購成功</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:Arial,'Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff7ed,#f0fdf4);padding:24px}.card{background:#fff;width:min(520px,100%);padding:48px 36px;border-radius:24px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.12)}.icon{width:82px;height:82px;margin:0 auto 22px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:#dcfce7;font-size:42px}h1{margin:0 0 14px;color:#166534;font-size:30px}p{color:#4b5563;line-height:1.8;font-size:17px;margin:0 0 26px}.info{background:#f8fafc;border-radius:14px;padding:16px;color:#64748b;font-size:14px}.food{font-size:28px;margin-bottom:12px}</style></head><body><main class=\"card\"><div class=\"icon\">✓</div><div class=\"food\">🍱</div><h1>訂購成功！</h1><p>您的便當訂單已經成功送出。<br>我們已為您儲存訂購資料，請安心等待美味午餐！</p><div class=\"info\">感謝您的訂購<br>祝您用餐愉快 😊</div></main></body></html>",
